  "title": "Archer Announces Second Quarter 2026 Results; Announces Deal with Boeing to Shape Physical AI Future of Aerospace and Defense",
  "summary": "Announced deal to acquire Boeing’s Wisk Aero, Insitu and SkyGrid to create an end-to-end physical AI platform for aerospace and defense and adding over $200M in annual revenue to Archer’s business with Boeing to invest in and collaborate with Archer. Unveiled Halo/Thunder, the commercial and defense variants of Archer’s jointly-developed autonomous, hybrid VTOL platform with Anduril. Announced ZEE, Archer’s AI foundation model purpose-built for aviation and its frontier breakthrough for aviation",
